------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiScan)
   Output: documentdb_api_internal.bson_dollar_project_find(document, '{ "a" : { "$numberInt" : "1" } }'::bson, '{ }'::bson, '{ "now" : NOW_SYS_VARIABLE }'::bson), documentdb_api_internal.current_cursor_state(document)
   cursorScanType: streamingPrimaryKey
   ->  Index Scan using _id_ on documentdb_data.documents_2601 collection
         Output: shard_key_value, object_id, document
         Filter: documentdb_api_internal.cursor_state(collection.document, '{ }'::bson)
(6 rows)

